      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not provide an explicit definition of the term “common factor”; it only reports a study investigating the “common factor structure” of mentalizing using factor-analytic methods.",
        "Claims that a common factor is “an underlying dimension … [that] groups related items into a shared component” are not directly stated in the packet as a definitional description of “common factor.”",
